**/.terraform/*
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
tfplan
*.tflock
# Child modules are validated with `init -backend=false`, which writes a lock
# file. Only the deployable roots pin providers.
modules/*/.terraform.lock.hcl
backend.hcl
terraform.tfvars
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
# Authoring artefacts: the design specs, task-by-task implementation plans, and
# per-task briefs/reviews the repository was built from. Kept locally, not
# published. .superpowers/ is otherwise only covered by a tool-generated nested
# .gitignore that reaches one subdirectory and can be regenerated away.
docs/superpowers/
.superpowers/
# draw.io writes these beside a diagram while it is open.
.$*.drawio.bkp
.$*.drawio.dtmp
